  "summary": "Graduated in March 2014 with a bachelors degree in Computer Science from California State University San Bernardino. Began a career with Northrop Grumman Corporation in San Diego as a Software Engineer I in July 2014. \n\nSelf-motivated and self starting professional with a passion for quality and development. i have experience working in an agile development environment where my responsibilities include, but are not limited to, development, continuous integration, networking, collaboration with other companies to achieve development goals, working with 3rd party vendors and software companies to make sure that my team will have access to all possible resources to perform daily functions.\n\n- Practice and application in data structures and algorithms using object oriented languages such as C++ and Java\n\n- Using Python programming language to create data analysis tools\n\n- Balanced and composed during high stress times and near deadlines\n\nPlease contact me to speak with me about my experiences, goals, and any possibilities with your organization.",
