    "description": "In the time that I have spent at Northrop Grumman I have worked on one project and supported another two. I have been involved in Software Integration Testing, Unit Testing, Peer Reviews, Developing Automated Test Tools and Scripts, as well as Software Development. In the process I have been exposed and gained knowledge of multiple tools and IDEs such as Microsoft Visual Studio, Eclipse, and Netbeans.\n\nI am currently working on lab networking, software integration, and setting up continuous integration tools and services. I am working closely with DevOps team to ensure that agile software process runs as seamlessly as possible.\n\nExperience with the following programming languages\nC++, and VisualBasic, Java, and postgresSQL databases. \nExperience with the following scripting languages\nWindows cmd shell scripting, Python, SenseTalk.\n\nExperience with these Software applications\nVirtualBox, VxWorks, Microsoft Visual Studio (2010), Winpython, MKS Integrity Client, IBM Rational Doors, TortoiseSVN, Eggplant, TestComplete, PurifyPlus, Teamcity CI, Jira, Confluence, Git and tortoise version control, sonarqube, Jenkins CO, and nexus.",
